        <activityName xml:lang="en">Phosphate rock mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Phosphate rock mine
Large uncertainties for equipment used due to weak data from only 2 mines and various assumtions.;
UUID: 0401cc1f-cb4f-3099-966f-b647359a4664
Mining equipment, equipment for beneficiation, buildings for beneficiation plant, land use of processing pant.
Location: Assumption for infrastructure based on weak data of 1 Moroccan and 1 U.S. mine.
Technology: No specific technology modelled
Time period: Time of literature publication. Measurements took place partly before this period.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimation from literature 
Extrapolations: Extrapolation from 1 U.S. and 1 Moroccan mine. The moroccan mine concerned has 30% market share, therefore representativeness set to 30%..
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0401cc1f-cb4f-3099-966f-b647359a4664.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
